 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Between us — What got you through the first week? The very first days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I just — Shock's underrated. It's the body's way of buying you time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Still on what got you through the first week.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Ole has been stockpiling where nobody looks. \"Take half. You've got the hands for it.\" (+4 wood, +4 fiber to the village stash.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? It'll pass.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Theo is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I wake before anyone else at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I can't reach this properly. Could you clean it out for me? Please.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Every day it's angrier. I need it cleaned before it turns — I can't work a wound like this. Wrap it tight when you're done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "A flicker at the corner of their mouth. Not quite a smile. Not quite anything."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "A wall comes down, then — surprisingly — a door opens behind it. \"I'm not from Denver. I'm from Columbus, Ohio. It's safer if people don't know. Please don't tell the others.\" Quiet. Real."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Still on that wound care.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Declan rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"That again?\" Declan sighs. \"I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Okay. I'll manage on my own.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Ruth glances around first. \"People are saying things. About you. Is any of it true?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "Quiet for a long time. Then, barely audible: \"I took 2× Stick. I won't do it again.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"What do you miss most? From before.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Oh! Oh — God. Yes. I dream about soup. Actual soup, with a spoon.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? Still on what you miss most.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Have you ever hurt someone? Since all this started.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They nod, slow. \"Okay. Thank you for telling me. That couldn't have been easy to say.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"I dreamed Theo was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Ruth grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"You said shock got you through the first week. Just kept moving. What's carrying you now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "🤝 Ole is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "You show them Purslane — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Theo owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I wake before anyone else for Theo, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about that wound care — we got cut off, 4 days back. 'That again? Declan sighs. I confessed that already. I'm not confessing it twice for dramatic effect.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"It's my brother, Stephen. Went up in the Taking with the boring half. He was the funniest person I knew. Their metrics are broken. Some nights I dream about the pods -- rows of them, humming. I wake up and I can't tell if it was a dream or a broadcast.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Since Theo died... I keep expecting to see Theo at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I do push-ups at dawn. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"They're already drifting away. \"Later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'I dreamed Theo was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "There's an ease between you now — the kind that takes weeks to build."
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"I have opinions about the name. I am saving them for when they count.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "Ole nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You're family now. Chosen family — the kind that actually counts.\" \"That's where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? We never finished talking about that personal stuff — we wandered off it, 7 days back. 'Sure — what's on your mind?'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "They light up a little when they see you."
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Like I said — Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up? …sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about Buffering last night — what to even CALL it. 'The Big Beast' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
