   "day": 54,
   "text": "Ruth nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 54,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"You missed a real hot meal. Soup, you said — with a spoon. Any of that turn up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "Ruth has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "They grin when they spot you — unguarded, for once."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling The Understudy? Declan is pushing 'Ugly-Eyes'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"My part? I tend the fire without being asked and stay neutral until there's a winner.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "Ole nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"We're down to 0 liters of clean water. Haul the creek with me at dawn? Two buckets each, there and back.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 0 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
