  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "«No entiendo nada. ¡Nada!»"
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod back, a little quicker this time."
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "They answer at length. A smile, tired but real. \"Water?\" — they grin, proud of the one English they know."
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "They answer at length. You press a hand to your own chest, then point at them. Together — they get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "You listen hard, watching their mouth shape the words. Sounds, and the shape of meaning just out of reach."
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "Tika laughs — with you, mostly. \"Good try! Again — Sí, sí, exacto..\" They walk you through it, patient as sunrise."
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 82,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"They'd tell me to keep working. So I'm working. That's the whole plan.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"I buried this before the Scattering. Seemed stupid to keep it secret.\" Declan digs up a wrapped bundle — food, still good. (+843 kcal to the pantry.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"I — yeah. It helps, hearing that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"We lost Tika and Desmond this week. I keep setting out extra portions. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Okay. That's — I need a minute. A long minute.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Every laugh out there feels wrong today. Then I feel wrong for thinking it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "Tariq has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Fine.\" Sharp. \"You want the truth? I'm not from Denver. I'm from Lahore, Pakistan. There are people from my old life I'd rather never find me. That's all. Happy now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Tika is gone and Desmond is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"I sleep in short shifts. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Right. Done. Don't look so relieved.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 85,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about grief — that was 9 days back. Still on your mind? 'Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I buried this before the Scattering. Seemed stupid to keep it secret.\" Tariq digs up a wrapped bundle — food, still good. (+839 kcal to the pantry.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"You're kind. Don't let this place change that.\""
