  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about The Influencer last night — what to even CALL it. 'Big Ugly' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"My part? I sleep in short shifts and stay neutral until there's a winner.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Ole nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I've got things to do. People to avoid. You know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Have you heard anything? About the taken. The pods. Anything at all.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Still nothing on Stephen. I told you about the pods -- I keep thinking about them. The humming. Some nights I'm sure it's a dream. Other nights I'm sure it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Have you heard what they're calling The Influencer? I'm pushing 'Big Ugly'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They take that in without interrupting."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Tariq nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...I need to go be quiet for a while.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that taken person.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. We're eating through stores faster than we replace them. Will you forage with me tomorrow? Two pairs of eyes, twice the ground.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. Meet me at the far treeline, past the rocks and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"I wasn't an ER nurse. I was a taxi driver. I thought if you believed me, you'd keep me close. Close is safe. I wasn't thinking about you at all — I'm sorry for that part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"...Okay. I'll figure it out.\" They won't ask twice. That much is clear."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"Still on that foraging help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"And... scene. Good talk.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"No — you're right, it's a lot. Forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the east treeline in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"I know you and Petra were close. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"Right. Done. Don't look so relieved.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 104,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
