    "bearerSample": [
     "Sari heads out to forage. \"Back before dark. Probably.\" The pantry won't fill itself.",
     "\"Tariq's gone.\" Sari looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Tariq.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face.",
     "At the grave, Sari, Petra speak for Zoltan — \"Tariq trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they stood their ground, poor brave fools.\" The spotlight widens. (No weight yet — just the story starting.) (5 verses remain. Contradict it — do th",
     "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they ran, and the spotlight followed.\" The spotlight narrows. Your dodge feels watched. (-10% dodge.) (4 verses remain. Contradict it — do the oppos",
     "📖 The Eulogy narrates, honestly, always: \"and then they bled, politely, where everyone could see.\" The narration lingers on your wounds. (Bleeds last 1 round longer.) (3 verses remain. Contradict it "
    ],
    "rumorSample": [],
    "crisisSample": [
     "🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.",
     "◈ The System names Zoltan: Stalker of the Apex Predator. The village repeats it at the fire.",
     "◈ THE SYSTEM has been watching Zoltan — Strange 1. Three offers; they took Static Toss. Earned, chosen. (static_toss: villager level-up)"
    ]
   },
