   "d43: You say a few words for Theo. Not a ceremony — just: you were here, and someone noticed you leaving. (-3 trauma)",
   "d43: Burying the bloating dead was honest work, and it cost you. Fever by nightfall. (-10 health)",
   "d43: You bury Theo. A marker, of sorts. The village will know where. (+4 trauma)"
  ],
