   "d43: \"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Theo is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\"",
   "d43: \"Good question.\" \"I dreamed Theo was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\"",
   "d47: \"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Theo owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\"",
   "d47: \"I wake before anyone else for Theo, now. Feels right. Feels like the least I can do.\"",
   "d47: \"Since Theo died... I keep expecting to see Theo at the fire. Stupid.\""
